cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SCA-TimeGraph, please cite this software. SCA-TimeGraph builds on the TimeGraph benchmark; if you use the TimeGraph generators or datasets, please also cite the TimeGraph reference listed below."
title: "SCA-TimeGraph: Selective Causal Adaptation for Evolving Time-Series Predictive Graphs"
type: software
# Author names follow the byline of the accompanying manuscript. Given/family splits and any ORCIDs
# should be confirmed by the authors; none has been invented here.
