version: "0.1.0"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Training-free, past-only (Granger-style) streaming estimator of evolving lagged predictive graphs with
  edgewise, persistence-gated plasticity, together with the experiment code and result files of the
  accompanying manuscript. The repository is derived from the TimeGraph synthetic benchmark
  (Ferdous, Hossain and Gani), whose MIT-licensed code (copyright 2025 Muhammad Hasan Ferdous; see LICENSE)
  and CC-BY-4.0 datasets (see LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.txt) are retained under their original licences.
keywords:
  - time series
  - Granger-style predictive graphs
  - streaming estimation
  - non-stationary data
  - causal discovery
references:
  - type: data
    title: "TimeGraph: Synthetic Benchmark Datasets for Robust Time-Series Causal Discovery"
    authors:
